## Description

Expected structure:
```
parameters:
  Cmax:      { label: "Cmax",      units: "ng/mL", digits: 3 }
  AUClast:   { label: "AUClast",   units: "h*ng/mL" }
  N_Samples: { label: "N Samples", digit_type: integer }
  ...
```






## Usage

```r
read_param_yaml(path)
```

## Arguments

<div class="arg-table">
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>Argument</th><th>Description</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>path</code></td>
<td>File path to the YAML.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>


## Value

Named list keyed by raw column name; each entry is a list with
`label`, `units`, `digits`, `digit_type` (any of
which may be missing). `digit_type` is `"sigfig"` (default),
`"decimal"`, `"integer"`, or `"raw"`.
